flowchart LR
  subgraph Laptop[Windows x64 laptop; no admin rights required]
    direction TB
    subgraph Bundle[MigraAI portable folder]
      direction TB
      Z[MigraAI/]
      Z --> PYDIR[python/<br/>embedded Python 3.12]
      Z --> APP[app/<br/>site-packages, models/, kb/]
      Z --> WEB[web/<br/>built React SPA]
      Z --> DOCS[docs/<br/>guide PDFs, diagram PNGs,<br/>report samples when present]
      Z --> README[README.txt]
      Z --> SC[start.cmd]
      APP --> PKGS[site-packages/<br/>MSVC runtime DLLs beside onnxruntime/capi]
      APP --> MODEL[models/ and kb/kb-v1.db]
      APP --> NOTICES[third-party-notices/]
      SC --> PY[python/python.exe -m migraai<br/>serves web/ on 127.0.0.1]
    end
    subgraph Runtime[Local runtime]
      direction LR
      CONV[Conversion client]
      PLAN[Planning client]
      KBREF[Optional KB refresh]
    end
    PY --> PORT[_free_port binds port 0<br/>OS selects an available port]
    PY --> BR[Opens browser with one-time launch token]
    PY --> CONV
    PY --> PLAN
    PY --> KBREF
    PY -. stores local app data .-> DATA[Default: %LOCALAPPDATA%\MigraAI<br/>MIGRAAI_DATA_DIR can override<br/>app.db, kb/, logs/, sessions/ wiped at start/exit]
  end
  subgraph External[Internet services, outbound HTTPS]
    direction TB
    DEVIN[Configured Devin API domain]
    VD[Vendor documentation sites]
  end
  CONV -->|conversion code after consent| DEVIN
  PLAN -->|planning: aggregate inventory counts only| DEVIN
  KBREF -. optional KB refresh .-> VD
